Sill for Android (unofficial)
Copyright 2026 Rahim Nathwani

An independent client for Sill (https://getsill.app), the Mac app by Noah Saffer. Not made, endorsed
or supported by Sill's developer. "Sill" names the Mac app this client works with.

This client implements Sill's wire protocol as documented in Sill's source code
(https://github.com/Saffsanity/sill, Sources/StreamProtocol), Copyright 2026 Noah Saffer, licensed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0. No Sill source code is included; constants and formats the
protocol requires (message kinds, the pairing proof's labels, the Damm table) are reproduced so the
two interoperate.
